{"1967530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plow the Snow!", "steam_appid": 1967530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/cc73ce31d0686084d246cffa2279818a.poster.avif?t=1777486729\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/cc73ce31d0686084d246cffa2279818a.webm?t=1777486729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/cc73ce31d0686084d246cffa2279818a.mp4?t=1777486729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As a cold spell falls upon the streets and parks of the city, Plow the Snow! to help your clients and neighbors get through this winter season. Use multiple machines and brave any obstacle in your path to make the sidewalks and streets free from the snowflake menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/87609ac97315b3f236c761d04f6c0694.poster.avif?t=1777486729\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/87609ac97315b3f236c761d04f6c0694.webm?t=1777486729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/87609ac97315b3f236c761d04f6c0694.mp4?t=1777486729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize, fuel and ride multiple machines - not really designated for fighting the snow, but you'll manage </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/2a0c3173b5c4b0b674ee28e7710882b1.poster.avif?t=1777486729\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/2a0c3173b5c4b0b674ee28e7710882b1.webm?t=1777486729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/2a0c3173b5c4b0b674ee28e7710882b1.mp4?t=1777486729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore various environments - clear the maps, get a rating and some prizes with it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/933edac951953eab409e8ab1427dcd99.poster.avif?t=1777486729\" width=624 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/933edac951953eab409e8ab1427dcd99.webm?t=1777486729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967530/extras/933edac951953eab409e8ab1427dcd99.mp4?t=1777486729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play alone or with up to 3 friends in the cooperative mode, the city needs all hands on deck! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"